                "text": "Did you know that a recent Louisiana audit shows so-called Medicaid \u201cfraud\u201d isn\u2019t about families or seniors abusing the system\u2014it\u2019s insurance companies being paid millions even after patients had passed away. #TuesdayTidbit #ProtectMedicaid Read my statement on this: https://t.co/tVS7l7jIfT",
