                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today we recognize our senior citizens, or as I like to call them, seasoned citizens. They\u2019ve given so much to our communities and deserve our deepest appreciation. Yet Trump has cut Medicaid and wants to cut Social Security, Medicare, and other programs they rely on. I\u2019ll keep fighting to ensure our seniors get the dignity and benefits they deserve. #SeniorCitizensDay",
