                "text": "We can\u2019t allow the dysfunction of government to punish everyday Americans by letting the National Flood Insurance Program lapse, leaving families and businesses without critical protection. That\u2019s why I introduced bipartisan legislation with @RepEzell and @RepFletcher to reauthorize the #NFIP through November 21, 2025, ahead of its scheduled expiration at 11:59 tonight.",
