                "text": "This government shutdown affects you, so I want to talk directly with you. Join me and @FamiliesUSA tomorrow at 10 AM CT for an Instagram Live, where we\u2019ll discuss Republicans\u2019\u00a0 healthcare cuts, #ACA tax credits, and what this means for you. https://t.co/gU0lzcBqOa",
