                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The government shutdown is hurting Louisianians. Families are facing uncertainty, critical services are at risk, and the #ACA premium tax credits that allow working families to afford the health insurance they need still haven\u2019t been extended. Make no mistake\u2014this is a Republican-owned shutdown. They shut down the government because they refuse to negotiate, even as we fight to protect health care for millions of Americans.\nhttps://t.co/UIWCPtX5eK",
