                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Did you know that undocumented immigrants are prohibited from receiving health coverage under the ACA, Medicare, and Medicaid? Nothing in Democrats\u2019 alternative Continuing Resolution government funding bill changes that. Instead, we\u2019re focused on fixing the Republican-created health care crisis by extending enhanced tax credits to protect Americans from skyrocketing premiums and striking cruel provisions in the #BigUglyLaw that gut Medicaid.",
