                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The National Flood Insurance Program has expired. This isn\u2019t just a procedural lapse or another partisan talking point \u2014 this is a serious, immediate problem for families, homeowners, and local economies across Louisiana, Mississippi, and the entire Gulf Coast. I sent a letter with @RepEzell to @SpeakerJohnson and @RepJeffries urging immediate action that addresses this lapse. \nhttps://t.co/sNCzaMi6j3",
