                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week on @talk1073  with @brianhaldane, we discussed the vote on releasing the Epstein files. I made it clear: transparency and justice must prevail. We also talked about progress on the National Flood Insurance Program. I was glad to help secure a short-term extension to prevent disruption for Gulf Coast homeowners, but I will continue pushing for a long-term, permanent solution. Listen:",
